{"asset_key":"ep7/quest_story_17103350","episode":"ep7","category":"quest_story","story_id":"17103350","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1710335001:1":{"text":"로완 도련님이 저러시는 걸 보니까 마음이 안 좋네...","source_cn":"看着罗万少爷这样子，心里真不好受啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8ED35630757C8F9C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1710335002:1":{"text":"도련님이 왜? 별로 달라진 걸 못 느끼겠는데.","source_cn":"罗万少爷怎么了？我没看出有什么变化啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AAC24856FEED03F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1710335003:1":{"text":"상회 사람들 모두 고대의 전당 실종 사건에 협조 요청을 받았잖아. 멀쩡하실 리가 없지!","source_cn":"商会的人都接到了协查圣古堂消失的通知，这还叫没什么事啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF47318DF06B14855","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1710335004:1":{"text":"아... 그거 그냥 왕실에 보여주려고 그러는 거 아니었어?","source_cn":"呃……这是做给王室看的吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x643B35766B5F6FEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1710335005:1":{"text":"그럴 리가! 로완 도련님은 진심이야. 오늘만 한숨을 쉰 횟수가 평소보다 10배는 많다고.","source_cn":"怎么可能！罗万少爷分明很上心，他今天叹气的次数比往常的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x148FB0504400B045","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1710335006:1":{"text":"페기 공주님이랑 사이 안 좋은 거 아니었어? 예전에 파혼 소동도 있었고...","source_cn":"罗万少爷不是和佩吉公主关系很差吗？之前逃婚那件事……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x917F15C1CDB35395","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1710335007:1":{"text":"쉿, 그건 옛날 얘기잖아. 입에 올리지 마!","source_cn":"嘘，那都是什么时候的事了，别再提了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x61D9966326680C00","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:秘银接待员埃莉诺":{"text":"미스릴 안내원 엘리노어","source":"秘银接待员埃莉诺","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:秘银仓管员菲利普":{"text":"미스릴 창고 관리자 필립","source":"秘银仓管员菲利普","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":2}}